{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0luZGlhbl9CYW5nbGEvMjAyMC0tQmVmb3JlL1N5c3RlbSUyMCUyODIwMTElMjkv","type":"movie","name":"System","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/uze6KGirRRiPc7Sr6WXWjFnpRme.jpg","description":"Mike is twenty, attractive, intelligent and a loner. He only shares his thoughts and an apartment in a prefabricated housing estate in Rostock with his best friend Dustin. There, on the roof with a view of the sea, they smoke their joints and sort stolen goods. Mike doesn't think beyond the next day. But everything changes when he is caught by Konrad Böhm during a break-in. The charismatic businessman introduces Mike to a parallel world of international lobbyists and former GDR secret service agents who have saved their networks for reunified Germany.","releaseInfo":"2011","genres":["Drama","Bengali"],"imdbRating":"4.8","runtime":"85 min","cast":["Jacob Matschenz","Bernhard Schütz","Jenny Schily","Heinz Hoenig","Florian Renner","Jürgen Holtz","Franziska Wulf","Rosa Enskat"],"director":["Marc Bauder"],"released":"2012-01-12T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jacob Matschenz","character":"Mike Hiller and Rolf Hiller","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/15AzdlqD13Bw0pLZC5pEItDFx0T.jpg"},{"name":"Bernhard Schütz","character":"Konrad Böhm","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/h3sRpqPmAHkcG5ifYfiRvArEV46.jpg"},{"name":"Jenny Schily","character":"Elke Hiller","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uLSzbVgZCL2v80G5eP2KIbExnVo.jpg"},{"name":"Heinz Hoenig","character":"Herbert Tieschky","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7UEy95iM0OLLThG26ZdLL0H8vPt.jpg"},{"name":"Florian Renner","character":"Dustin"},{"name":"Jürgen Holtz","character":"Zschernigk","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/FKY2fcxvNBSjQEScwmlYrIIl9x.jpg"},{"name":"Franziska Wulf","character":"Janine","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yxGsAKnrJZs2g6q4unNgkfm7NAA.jpg"},{"name":"Rosa Enskat","character":"Rita","photo":"https://imag